WEBVTT

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:51.050
The truth is, I will be auditioning.

00:01:51.050 --> 00:01:52.390
Really?

00:01:52.630 --> 00:01:56.990
Yes. I'm thinking of singing the song you gave me.

00:01:56.990 --> 00:01:57.990
Would that be all right?

00:01:59.610 --> 00:02:00.860
I'm so happy to hear that.

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:03.830
Good luck on your audition.

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:06.390
Thanks.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:09.810
<i>A historical musical?</i>

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:18.040
<i>Mister Hijirikawa, they offered you this audition because they want you!</i>

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:21.080
<i>They said they liked you when they saw you at your concert.</i>

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:22.600
<i>Me?</i>

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:24.810
<i>It's amazing, Ma!</i>

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:29.790
<i>This super-hot stage created quite a stir in the theater community!</i>

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:33.300
<i>This is a big chance to make your own name more widely known,</i>

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:35.350
<i>Mister Hijirikawa!</i>

00:02:35.350 --> 00:02:41.130
<i>Sign on with them and use it as a step towards winning the Uta☆</i>Pri Award!

00:02:45.730 --> 00:02:51.820
<i>I have studied the fundamentals, but serious acting is unfamiliar to me.</i>

00:02:55.910 --> 00:02:57.310
Masa, are you here?

00:02:57.310 --> 00:02:58.750
We heard the news.

00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:00.860
You're auditioning for the lead role?

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:02.100
Yes.

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:05.210
Really? Let me see the script.

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:06.820
Let's see...

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:10.600
Out of the way! Out of the way!

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:13.700
Master Ren is coming through!

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:23.340
I will avenge my mother!

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:39.760
Revenge? Don't say such scandalous things.

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:41.190
Isn't that right, Master Ren?

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:42.490
Yes.

00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:45.990
Just because he's a child,

00:03:46.470 --> 00:03:48.250
I won't go easy on those who defy me.

00:03:52.050 --> 00:03:56.520
I'm sorry, but you'd better say your prayers.

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:57.590
Wait!

00:04:00.770 --> 00:04:03.400
Don't do this to a child.

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:04.410
What?

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:08.920
I don't recognize you.

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:10.390
Leave him to me.

00:04:23.420 --> 00:04:25.030
H-He's... strong!

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:28.370
You're no ordinary man, are you?

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:32.240
Leave... or I will cut you down.

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:37.000
You won't get away with this!

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:41.000
Are you okay?

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:44.120
Th-Thank you...

00:04:47.910 --> 00:04:49.080
My mother

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:52.730
suffered from a long illness and was confined to bed,

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:55.040
but she had energy...

00:04:56.250 --> 00:05:00.800
But since he showed up, prices have been rising,

00:05:01.310 --> 00:05:04.480
and poor people like us couldn't afford to buy medicine anymore.

00:05:06.260 --> 00:05:07.990
I'm sorry, Mom...

00:05:09.270 --> 00:05:11.110
I'm sorry I couldn't avenge you...

00:05:14.070 --> 00:05:16.750
If he is a demon living among people...

00:05:17.930 --> 00:05:19.670
he must be punished.

00:05:25.910 --> 00:05:27.560
Don't say anything.

00:05:28.150 --> 00:05:31.840
I simply wish for you

00:05:33.290 --> 00:05:35.600
to know how I feel.

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:36.990
I have

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:40.440
always loved you.

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:48.410
This looks interesting.

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:50.750
Historical plays get pretty intense, don't they?

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:54.980
Shou, you're much more suited to being a villager instead of a samurai.

00:05:54.980 --> 00:05:56.760
What's that supposed to mean?

00:05:56.760 --> 00:05:59.090
Hey, Masa, we'll help you practice.

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:02.090
It's fine. I'll do it myself.

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:04.290
What? But why?

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:06.970
We'll do anything to help you land the lead role.

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:10.440
I have always loved you!

00:06:11.090 --> 00:06:12.580
Wh-What's wrong with you?

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:13.650
Always...

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:14.410
What?!

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:19.840
"The protagonist grabs her by the shoulders, and they embrace passionately."

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:19.850
Stop that! Let go of me!

00:06:20.180 --> 00:06:20.940
I will not!

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:22.810
It's all about this scene.

00:06:23.830 --> 00:06:28.090
Hearing the beautiful woman confess her passionate feelings for him, they embrace...

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:30.110
It's easy.

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:34.280
An embrace is something that occurs naturally

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:36.230
once the feelings of both people reach a boiling point.

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:39.060
How am I supposed to do that with a girl I'm meeting

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:40.200
for the first time at the audition?

00:06:40.490 --> 00:06:42.920
Hey, now. It's just acting, right?

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:45.700
Masa, why don't you relax a little?

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:50.040
Fools. An embrace is not to be taken lightly.

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:53.050
Yeah, but you need to be able to do this...

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:57.460
You need to be able to squeeze her.

00:06:57.460 --> 00:06:58.980
Don't say it so easily.

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:02.330
Good grief. At this rate, you'll fail.

00:07:03.850 --> 00:07:06.290
Mind your own business.

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:08.730
I don't need your assistance.

00:07:08.730 --> 00:07:10.690
I can do this myself.

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:14.710
Masa...

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:34.660
Wh-What is this?

00:07:34.660 --> 00:07:36.890
I found it when I woke up this morning.

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:40.350
I can't believe he wrote this and left.

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:43.460
He seems awfully troubled.

00:07:54.390 --> 00:07:56.670
If I clear my mind of all mundane thoughts,

00:07:56.670 --> 00:07:59.550
an embrace is nothing to fear.

00:07:59.550 --> 00:08:00.920
Katsu!

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:11.620
You've come awfully far.

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:15.210
Your grandfather will be pleased.

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:23.130
<i>It's one year.</i>

00:08:24.460 --> 00:08:27.410
<i>Do you know of Saotome Academy?</i>

00:08:27.410 --> 00:08:30.140
<i>I believe it is a performing arts academy.</i>

00:08:30.770 --> 00:08:34.140
<i>Your father opposes it, of course,</i>

00:08:34.140 --> 00:08:39.410
<i>but your mind is full of thoughts other than taking over the family business.</i>

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:44.730
<i>It would be possible for me to bend your will</i>

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:46.590
<i>and convince you to take over the family business.</i>

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:48.910
<i>However,</i>

00:08:48.910 --> 00:08:55.000
<i>I am the one who taught you to enjoy the performing arts.</i>

00:08:56.880 --> 00:09:00.170
<i>The performing arts are just like these flowers.</i>

00:09:01.150 --> 00:09:03.720
<i>It's not something to be done alone.</i>

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:09.190
<i>With those who perform with you, support you, and watch you,</i>

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:12.200
<i>it is something to be made together.</i>

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:20.020
Wake up by yourself in the morning.

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:22.550
You wake up too early, Camus.

00:09:22.550 --> 00:09:23.610
Hush.

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:27.530
Tomorrow, you'll begin studying television programs early in the morning.

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:30.480
What? That early?

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:33.270
An idol must charm people.

00:09:33.270 --> 00:09:35.300
Don't complain about trivial difficulties.

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:39.300
Write a report about everything you learned today, and turn it in to me.

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:40.410
What?

00:09:41.450 --> 00:09:42.620
Is there a problem?

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:43.840
No...

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:57.820
Camus is always getting mad at me.

00:09:58.180 --> 00:10:01.910
Are you all right, Cecil?

00:10:05.920 --> 00:10:07.940
Cecil?!

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:12.540
I feel so relaxed in your room.

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:13.200
Huh?

00:10:14.580 --> 00:10:15.040
What?

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:20.260
I wanted to spend time relaxing with you.

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:21.210
What?

00:10:21.860 --> 00:10:25.350
W-Wait, Cecil!

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:27.850
We mustn't! This... this isn't...

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:37.430
This flower...

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:42.120
It's an important keepsake.

00:10:43.260 --> 00:10:48.880
The day I met you was the beginning for everyone.

00:10:50.030 --> 00:10:52.970
I want to treasure it forever.

00:10:54.390 --> 00:10:58.380
You must really love ST☆RISH.

00:10:58.590 --> 00:10:59.300
What?

00:11:01.620 --> 00:11:05.490
Haruka, what's so great about them?

00:11:05.710 --> 00:11:08.090
What? Well...

00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:15.480
They sparkle, and it makes me want to watch them forever.

00:11:15.850 --> 00:11:17.820
What does that mean?

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:21.650
<i>An idol must charm people.</i>

00:11:25.520 --> 00:11:26.930
Cecil?

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:28.910
You...

00:11:30.760 --> 00:11:32.830
You are their prisoner...

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:43.020
Masa, welcome back.

00:11:43.020 --> 00:11:44.390
We're ready.

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:47.130
What are you talking about?

00:11:47.130 --> 00:11:49.980
We can't just ignore you when you're so worried about something.

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:53.060
We decided to help you practice.

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:57.770
This isn't only your audition.

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:02.050
Our Uta☆Pri Award depends on this.

00:12:02.050 --> 00:12:03.480
Let us help you.

00:12:05.130 --> 00:12:07.200
Because I will help you practice...

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:10.170
You <i>will</i> succeed.

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:14.040
Ichinose?! Wh-Why are you dressed like that?

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:19.630
Tokiya has the most experience, so we asked him to play the girl.

00:12:20.770 --> 00:12:21.380
What?

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:25.910
<i>The performing arts are not something to be done alone.</i>

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:28.350
<i>It is something to be made together.</i>

00:12:32.950 --> 00:12:34.310
You guys...

00:12:34.510 --> 00:12:37.040
Is it all right, Masa?

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:37.840
Yes.

00:12:37.840 --> 00:12:39.400
All right!

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:42.350
Let's get started.

00:12:43.020 --> 00:12:45.350
We'll start at this part of this scene.

00:12:46.230 --> 00:12:49.550
Huh? Cecil, good timing.

00:12:49.550 --> 00:12:51.290
What are you doing?

00:12:51.480 --> 00:12:54.410
Over here. Take a seat.

00:12:55.230 --> 00:12:56.250
What's going on?

00:12:56.840 --> 00:12:59.190
We're helping Masa practice for his audition.

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:02.090
We're just the audience, though.

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:05.970
Who cares? Just watch quietly.

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:07.940
Oh, okay.

00:13:09.270 --> 00:13:10.810
It's starting.

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:14.770
I have always loved you.

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:17.640
Forget about me.

00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:21.860
I am not a man who can reciprocate your feelings.

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:26.950
Even so, why does it have to be you?

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:29.780
Why do you put yourself in danger?

00:13:31.310 --> 00:13:33.490
Tokiya's amazing.

00:13:33.490 --> 00:13:36.460
All right. Now he tightly embraces the girl.

00:13:38.070 --> 00:13:40.980
What? What are you doing?

00:13:40.980 --> 00:13:42.440
I-I'm sorry.

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:44.690
Let's go one more time.

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:46.310
O-Okay...

00:13:59.300 --> 00:14:00.730
All right! You can do it!

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:02.320
Overcome the hurdle of embracing!

00:14:05.230 --> 00:14:07.370
I'm sorry, Ichinose!

00:14:08.190 --> 00:14:11.360
I cannot embrace you!

00:14:11.360 --> 00:14:15.240
Wh-Why not? My acting should be perfect...

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:18.540
He was so close.

00:14:19.260 --> 00:14:22.500
I thought he could do it with Icchi's acting.

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:26.330
What are we going to do? The audition is tomorrow.

00:14:26.330 --> 00:14:30.030
Why is a man performing the role of the girl?

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:33.420
There is no woman, so I'm doing it.

00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:35.270
But there's Haruka.

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:35.690
What?

00:14:36.110 --> 00:14:38.020
You...

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:40.260
That might actually be a good idea.

00:14:40.260 --> 00:14:41.060
What?!

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:45.010
That's right. Why didn't we think of it earlier?

00:14:45.010 --> 00:14:47.780
Let's ask Nanami to do it! I'm sure that'll be...

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:49.040
No, it's fine.

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:49.640
What?

00:14:50.850 --> 00:14:54.110
I can't cause Nanami any trouble.

00:14:54.110 --> 00:14:55.010
But...

00:14:55.880 --> 00:14:58.870
It's all right. I'll do something about it.

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:22.460
Masato.

00:15:25.790 --> 00:15:27.050
Aijima?

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:30.470
What are you doing up there?

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:35.910
You prefer being outside rather than sharing a room with your senior.

00:15:36.560 --> 00:15:38.890
You're struggling as well, aren't you?

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:42.970
Are you sure you're all right with the audition, Masato?

00:15:44.730 --> 00:15:47.880
Why did you become an idol, Masato?

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:51.300
Why do you ask?

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:54.800
I'm simply curious.

00:15:57.720 --> 00:16:00.770
I have always been interested in performing arts.

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:07.730
Knowing it would never come true, I kept my dream hidden deep in my heart.

00:16:09.340 --> 00:16:18.200
However, one day, someone awakened my secret passion and lead me to this path.

00:16:21.490 --> 00:16:24.970
Because of her, I am here now.

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:27.540
Does that answer your question?

00:16:29.570 --> 00:16:32.260
You must love that woman.

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:40.560
If you put that passion into your acting, you will surely succeed.

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:45.620
If you imagine the other actor as the woman you love,

00:16:45.620 --> 00:16:47.680
embracing her will be easy.

00:16:48.380 --> 00:16:49.820
Imagine her, you say?

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:56.410
Hijirikawa, I've always loved you...

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:58.110
N-No!

00:16:58.110 --> 00:16:59.370
Why?

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:01.650
I could never do something so base!

00:17:01.650 --> 00:17:04.000
Acting isn't real!

00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:05.800
I know that!

00:17:05.800 --> 00:17:09.340
To the audience, a play is a world of dreams, and the actors...

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:13.090
<i>A good actor</i>

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:18.310
<i>enters the world of dreams with his audience.</i>

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:23.290
<i>Forgetting the transient world,</i>

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:28.950
<i>the audience and actors enjoy a fleeting dream together.</i>

00:17:35.140 --> 00:17:38.990
Aijima, thank you.

00:17:39.520 --> 00:17:41.990
What? Masato?

00:17:46.680 --> 00:17:50.140
<i>Grandfather, watch me.</i>

00:17:54.910 --> 00:17:57.840
Next person, please get ready.

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:02.680
I am Shining Agency's Hijirikawa Masato.

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:04.220
Thank you for your consideration.

00:18:05.970 --> 00:18:11.570
<i>If you put that passion into your acting, you will surely succeed.</i>

00:18:14.630 --> 00:18:17.320
Who are you?

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:22.710
Get him! Get him!

00:18:22.710 --> 00:18:24.330
Kill the rogue!

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:44.600
Hey, wait!

00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:47.420
I-Is it money you want?

00:18:47.420 --> 00:18:48.730
How about this?

00:18:49.370 --> 00:18:51.480
Do not misjudge me, heretic!

00:18:52.050 --> 00:18:57.780
Because of you, there are those who must live in the shadows!

00:19:08.900 --> 00:19:10.960
Why, you...

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:28.550
I'll never let you go.

00:19:28.550 --> 00:19:29.810
Lord Masa.

00:19:31.950 --> 00:19:34.710
I love you more than anyone else.

00:19:44.610 --> 00:19:45.730
Wonderful!

00:19:45.730 --> 00:19:48.290
I've never seen an audition like this!

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:50.730
He moved me as much as an actual performance!

00:19:54.180 --> 00:19:57.130
<i>This is what it means to perform.</i>

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:02.430
This is acting.

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:05.110
This...

00:20:09.710 --> 00:20:12.030
All right! Congratulations, Masa!

00:20:12.030 --> 00:20:13.850
You finally broke down your wall!

00:20:13.850 --> 00:20:17.070
I knew you could do it, Masato!

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:21.030
Hijirikawa!

00:20:21.850 --> 00:20:25.110
Congratulations on passing the audition.

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:28.870
Thank you. It was all because of you, Nanami.

00:20:32.050 --> 00:20:32.790
What?

00:20:35.100 --> 00:20:36.880
N-Nothing.

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:40.340
Nanami,

00:20:42.320 --> 00:20:45.080
I want you to come watch me perform.

00:20:46.710 --> 00:20:48.600
I'll definitely go.

00:20:49.030 --> 00:20:50.840
I'll let you know once the date is decided.

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:52.590
Thank you so much.

00:20:52.590 --> 00:20:54.420
Well, I need to get going.

00:20:58.190 --> 00:21:02.460
<i>You saved me again, Nanami.</i>

00:21:03.460 --> 00:21:05.780
So that's how it is.

00:21:06.580 --> 00:21:08.440
Aijima? You again?

00:21:08.880 --> 00:21:12.740
It's Haruka, isn't it? The girl you love.

00:21:15.780 --> 00:21:17.580
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:21:18.240 --> 00:21:21.800
Why don't you tell her you love her?

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:24.970
What? What are you talking about?

00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:27.340
Why do you hide it?

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:30.720
Have you not confessed your feelings to her yet?

00:21:31.700 --> 00:21:32.730
Why not?

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:36.070
There's no need for me to speak of that with you.

00:21:36.070 --> 00:21:39.780
Oh, I see. Is it because idols are forbidden to love?

00:21:39.780 --> 00:21:40.440
No!

00:21:41.480 --> 00:21:43.630
Because I keep my feelings hidden...

00:21:44.470 --> 00:21:46.400
Because they are so important to me, I cannot say them.

00:21:46.630 --> 00:21:48.550
What are you talking about?

00:21:48.550 --> 00:21:51.790
I don't understand why you can't tell her when she's right next to you.

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:52.830
It's all right.

00:21:54.030 --> 00:21:58.830
I am connected to her through the bond of music.

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:01.670
The bond of music?

00:22:03.380 --> 00:22:07.240
By singing Nanami's songs...

00:22:08.450 --> 00:22:12.930
I believe I am firmly bound to her.

00:22:14.910 --> 00:22:20.310
That is why it is enough for now.

00:22:23.590 --> 00:22:26.660
<i>They sparkle.</i>

00:22:28.040 --> 00:22:32.460
<i>Connected to Haruka... through the bond of music...</i>
